            "title": "Land vs Building Allocation Advisor",
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Guidance on supportable land and building basis numbers, a complex step that requires deep expertise.",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "\"How do I determine my tax basis?\" is the most common question we get. Our advisor automates the county assessment allocation for you whenever available.",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "An appraisal is always best, but most do not include a land and building split. We pull assessor data to allocate based on the county assessment so you do not have to.",
