              }
            ],
            "author": "John Z.",
            "role": null
          },
          {
            "quote": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "I conducted a cost segregation analysis for one of my clients through the website. Their staff was helpful throughout the process. There is a good bit of work to develop the data that you need for the inputs, but the KBKG web interface makes it easy to input the data and gives you a quality […]",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "author": "Brian R.",
            "role": null
          },
          {
            "quote": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "KBKG’s CostSegregation.com software is an absolute game-changer! Not only is it incredibly easy to use, but it also comes at a much lower cost compared to hiring an engineering firm–easily saving me at least $2,000. The interface is straightforward, making the process smooth and efficient.",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "author": "Shawn G.",
            "role": null
          },
          {
            "quote": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Been using this for my personal cost segregation studies for my multi and strs for 5 years now and the software continues to get better and better throughout the years.. I recommend to all my friends.",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "author": "Ramsey K.",
            "role": null
          },
          {
            "quote": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "I love being able to have control over getting my own Cost Segregation Study completed for my properties. This is a great online tool!",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "author": "Elizabeth D.",
            "role": null
          },
          {
            "quote": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "CostSegregation.com is an easy to use tool for real estate owners to maximize their deductions early on in the ownership of the property. You don’t need to be an accountant to use the tool, you can share the output with the accountant. You have to know some details about the home.",
                "spans": [],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "author": "Jungwoo K.",
            "role": null
          }
